{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "breeder-mobile-sap-sync-001",
    "name": "KRISHI Breeder — Mobile SAP sync (minimal)",
    "description": "Breeder mobile SAP sync routes (JWT).\n\n- POST /api/sap-sync/mobile-latest — syncs latest unsynced row **you saved today (IST)** for `module` (no record_id). Row must have `entered_by` = your user id.\n- POST /api/sap-sync — push one row by `record_id` (mobile: business date must be **today IST** unless admin role).\n\nRoutes: src/routes/sapSync.js → sapSyncController.syncLatestMobile / markSynced.\n\nModules: feeding, egg_collection, mortality, cull_kill, cull_sales, bird_weighing, bird_receipt.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "admin" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "admin123" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "module", "value": "feeding" },
    { "key": "record_id", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 — POST /api/admin/login (sets token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/login",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "let j = {};",
              "try { j = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
              "const t = j.token || j.data?.token || j.access_token || '';",
              "if (t) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 — POST /api/sap-sync/mobile-latest (today IST, your latest unsynced row)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/sap-sync/mobile-latest",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"module\": \"{{module}}\"\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3 — POST /api/sap-sync (by record_id — mobile today rule applies)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/sap-sync",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"module\": \"{{module}}\",\n  \"record_id\": {{record_id}}\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4 — GET /api/sap-sync/status",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/sap-sync/status?module={{module}}&record_id={{record_id}}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
